    "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again. The Edit Dock shortcut is independent." : {
      "comment" : "Keyboard shortcut recording guidance",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again. The Edit Dock shortcut is independent."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
